      "lineNbr": 1335,
      "author": {
        "id": 1758351
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-15T13:14:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks. We do need to start the netlink monitor when the service start. If we call this inside startMonitoringSockets(), we will miss the netlink events happened before because the startMonitoringSockets() will be called if some app actually call NsdService. However, the tethering interface can went up anytime.",
      "parentUuid": "bf435199_f5e2a6d4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1335,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 1335,
        "endChar": 63
